
- To create project
  ng new <project name>
  
- To check version
  ng v
  
  Open the code in VS code
  
- To start the application:
  ng serve / ng s
  
Open the link as given in terminal http://localhost:4200/

- To build the project
  ng b / ng build
  
- To create component
  ng generate component <name of component> / ng g c <name of component>
  
- To create bootstrap
  npm install bootstrap
  
- To generate custom pipe
  ng generate pipe <name of pipe>
  
- To create standalone component
  ng g c <name of component> --standalone
 